m, military service, tower, etc. <br>Finding your own gameplay-optimized build is the way to survive.<br>'Is this a lazy gimmick to increase play time?' <br>No, you can only buy and build once.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[bad and Good Taste Soliders]</strong></h2>Soldiers have various attack methods and personalities according to their characteristics<br>Of course, don't forget that soldiers are looking for their favorite heroes.<br>Oh, and there are also bad taste soldiers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[various Item and Gear]</strong></h2>You can get various items and gear from battle victory rewards.<br>'Is there such a thing as this in a game that seems complex and difficult?'<br>Don't worry, the item is used automatically, and the gear has a Passiive effect.<br>You just have to choose<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[artifact]</strong></h2>There are fantastic artifacts that will lead you to victory in difficult battles.<br>If you find out, the game will be more attractive and fantastic to play.<br>But... obviously hard to find<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296870/extras/1e77a4e77c975f848f88b790308e9f23.poster.avif?t=1680570310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296870/extras/1e77a4e77c975f848f88b790308e9f23.webm?t=1680570310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296870/extras/1e77a4e77c975f848f88b790308e9f23.mp4?t=1680570310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
